o the battlefield as a defender operator to maintain an active mind.","abilities":["Takes greatly reduced Arts and Physical damage when force field is active; force field breaks when a large amount of damage is taken in a single instance"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":60000,"atk":1400,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"leafcarpet":{"slug":"leafcarpet","name":"Leafcarpet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Leafcarpet.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An orphan that Sharp brought to Rhodes Island. When in peak condition, she is fast enough to give Sharp a run for his money, and was thus recruited into his squad. Not happy with how Sharp often goes solo.","abilities":["Unblockable","Accelerates when moving, stuns units along her path for a few seconds, and deals Physical damage based on her current Movement Speed","Temporarily gains a large Fragile effect if movement is interrupted"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":600,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"uproar":{"slug":"uproar","name":"Uproar","icon":"/enemies-icons/Uproar.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Stormeye's drinking buddy who met him when he was still a wanderer, and later joined Rhodes Island together. She taught Stormeye how to hold his drink.","abilities":["Takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage when unblocked, then fires a rain of arrows, dealing splash damage to units around the damage source and greatly reducing their ASPD","Rebirth"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":1500,"def":1200,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDa